(3) Demotion;
(4) Transfer;
(5) Layoff;
(6) Termination;
(7) Rates of pay and other forms of compensation;
(8) Training programs and selection for training, apprenticeship;
(9) Recruitment advertising, recruitment efforts;
(10) Employment goals;
(11) Written plan to achieve those goals with timetables.

